        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK091PV Contemporary Round Pocket Lock Privacy</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll new contemporary design round sliding pocket door privacy lock that offers both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete set that includes the privacy mortise lock body, two (2) flush pulls, an edge pull, a strike plate and all mounting hardware. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 high quality finishes and for both <b>1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe round edge pull is pressure mounted into the doors edge. The round flush pulls are pressure mounted into the doors face - no screws show for a clean contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-pocket-door-passage-set-reguitti-sdk091pa\"><b>Contemporary Round Pocket Door Pull Set</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/double-pocket-door-lock-set-reguitti-sdk091pv-pa\"><b>Contemporary Round Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK091PV Contemporary Round Pocket Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Height: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Faceplate Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Diameter: 1-7/8\" (48 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection:  1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection:  3/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1272\">Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK091PV.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK091PV Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK091PV-SDK092PV-template.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK091PV Instalation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The inside thumb turn <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) flush pulls, edge pull, strike plate and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Round Pocket Lock Privacy, Reguitti SDK091PV",
                "description": "All new contemporary round sliding pocket door privacy lock offering both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete set that includes the privacy mortise lock body, two (2) flush pulls, an edge pull, a strike plate and all mounting hardware. Available in 4 high quality finishes and work on both 1-3/8 or 1-3/4 inch thick pocket doors.",
